OL,3,AAttacks families not told 'stalker' had
OL,4,Aviolent past
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies of the Nottingham attacks
OL,7,Fvictims said police did not tell them a
OL,8,Fman who had taken an interest in them
OL,9,Fhad a history of violence when he
OL,10,Fattempted to visit them.
OL,12,FBarnaby Webber, Grace O'Malley-Kumar
OL,13,Fand Ian Coates were fatally stabbed by
OL,14,FValdo Calocane, who had been diagnosed
OL,15,Fwith paranoid schizophrenia in 2020, on
OL,16,F13 June 2023. He tried to kill three
OL,17,Fothers.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
