OL,3,AAttacks families not told 'stalker' had
OL,4,Aviolent past
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrace's father, Dr Sanjoy Kumar, said
OL,7,Fhe was told in 2025 that a man had
OL,8,Fvisited his GP surgery in London. Emma
OL,9,FWebber, Barnaby's mother, said he had
OL,10,Falso travelled to Somerset, but neither
OL,11,Fwere informed of the man's history of
OL,12,Fmental ill health.
OL,14,FNottinghamshire Police said it had
OL,15,Freceived a complaint and referred the
OL,16,Fmatter to the Independent Office for
OL,17,FPolice Conduct (IOPC).
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
